OL,3,AZimbabwe issues arrest warrant for
OL,4,ARobert Mugabe's son over missed court
OL,5,Adate
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Zimbabwean court has issued an arrest
OL,8,Fwarrant for Bellarmine Chatunga Mugabe,
OL,9,Fthe youngest son of the country's late
OL,10,Fformer president Robert Mugabe, after
OL,11,Fhe failed to appear in court.
OL,13,FMugabe was arrested earlier this month
OL,14,Falongside four others over assault
OL,15,Fallegations on a police officer during
OL,16,Fan investigation into the suspected
OL,17,Fsmuggling of luxury vehicles.
OL,19,FThe group subsequently faced charges of
OL,20,Frobbery and malicious damage to
OL,21,Fproperty. They have yet to enter pleas.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
